Rāma sits ringed by jesting counselors --- Rāma asks Bhadra talk of city provinces and household --- Bhadra reports praise of bridge and Rāvaṇa killing --- Rāma demands whole truth fearlessly --- Bhadra tells citizens mock keeping Rāvaṇa-held Sītā --- Subjects vow copying king with wives --- Rāma confirms report with friends and dismisses them